{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 0, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 1, "text": "嘿，就是你！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 2, "text": "大聰明！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 3, "text": "你想出去嗎？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 4, "text": "那就幫我找找鑰匙吧！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 5, "text": "// Key Search"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 6, "text": "可惡，鑰匙不在這裡！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 7, "text": "這裡是空的！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 8, "text": "根本甚麼都沒有！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 9, "text": "找到了！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 10, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 11, "text": "// The usual conversation"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 12, "text": "我還以為你會再矮一點呢！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 13, "text": "結果你長得這麼高！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 14, "text": "就像姐姐一樣！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 15, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 16, "text": "呃…姐姐？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 17, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 18, "text": "對，姐姐。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 19, "text": "難道你沒見過她嗎！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 20, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 21, "text": "見過？豈止見過。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 22, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 23, "text": "你是笨蛋嗎？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 24, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 25, "text": "呃…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 26, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 27, "text": "看來真的是個笨蛋…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 28, "text": "來吧，快幫我找找鑰匙！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 29, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 30, "text": "// Next work"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 31, "text": "來。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 32, "text": "把這些鐵丟進管子裡！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 33, "text": "謝謝！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 34, "text": "現在把木柴拿下來給我！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 35, "text": "謝謝！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 36, "text": "幫我一下！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 37, "text": "完成了！你瞧…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 38, "text": "看，多漂亮啊…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 39, "text": "來，按下它！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 40, "text": "準備完成！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 41, "text": "這就行了，拿著吧！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 42, "text": "鑰匙是你的了！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 43, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 44, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 45, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 46, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 47, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 48, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 49, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 50, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 51, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 52, "text": "// Quest 1 (Are you Mita?)"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 53, "text": "我是Q版米塔.fbx！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 54, "text": "我有超多臺詞，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 55, "text": "最簡單的建模，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 56, "text": "還有最漂亮的頭髮！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 57, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 58, "text": "// Quest 2 (Have we seen each other yet?)"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 59, "text": "大笨蛋先生，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 60, "text": "你問愚蠢問題的樣子"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 61, "text": "真可愛。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 62, "text": "雖然，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 63, "text": "這是我第一次見到你哦！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 64, "text": "不過…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 65, "text": "如果有人敢盜用我美妙的形象，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 66, "text": "我會狠狠地譴責他！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 67, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 68, "text": "// Quest 3 (Why are you here?)"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 69, "text": "你還不明白嗎？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 70, "text": "這裡是一個檢查點！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 71, "text": "檢查你智力的地方"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 72, "text": "過去吧！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 73, "text": "我專門護送迷路的笨蛋！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 74, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 75, "text": "// Quest 4 (Why are you helping me?)"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 76, "text": "你有甚麼特殊之處，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 77, "text": "為甚麼不幫你呢？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 78, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 79, "text": "甚麼？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 80, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 81, "text": "真傻，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 82, "text": "都不知道你從哪裡鑽出來的！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 83, "text": "你不應該在這裡，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 84, "text": "所以我才要幫你！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 85, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 86, "text": "再見了，大笨蛋！"}
